Description: Reads and writes 'JSON' with the header-only C++ library 'Glaze'
    <https://github.com/stephenberry/glaze>. Provides a subset of the
    'jsonlite' interface: toJSON() and fromJSON() convert between R objects
    and 'JSON' text, write_json() and read_json() work on files, and
    stream_out() and stream_in() handle newline-delimited 'JSON'. Arrays and
    data frames are written to files incrementally, so that a document can be
    larger than a single R string.
